      "date": "2026-05-29T06:30:00.000Z",
      "title": "Polymac Thermoformers Limited Announces Appointment of Puspjeet Kumar as Director, Effective May 29, 2026",
      "body": "Polymac Thermoformers Limited had appointed Mr. Puspjeet Kumar (DIN: 00548463) as Non Executive Director of the Company with effect from May 29, 2026. The appointment was approved in the Board Meeting held on May 29, 2026. Mr. Puspjeet Kumar (DIN: 00548463) is a Chartered Accountant and has wide experience in Corporate Tax, Transfer Pricing, Business Restructuring, Expatriate Taxation, Company Law etc.",
      "keyDevTypeId": "16",
      "source_url": null,
      "raw_subtype": "EventActivity"
    },
    {
      "id": "419755ba-37fd-48d7-a757-e7aa393f872d",
      "type": "brief",
      "date": "2026-05-22T20:59:05.000Z",
      "title": "Full year 2026 earnings released: EPS: ₹0.02 (vs ₹0.09 in FY 2025)",
      "body": "Full year 2026 results: EPS: ₹0.02 (down from ₹0.09 in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹134.5m (up 57% from FY 2025). Net income: ₹115.0k (down 74% from FY 2025). Profit margin: 0.1% (down from 0.5% in FY 2025). The decrease in margin was driven by higher expenses. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has fallen by 31% per year but the company’s share price has only fallen by 23% per year, which means it has not declined as severely as earnings.",
      "keyDevTypeId": null,
      "source_url": null,
      "raw_subtype": "BriefActivity"
